  "description": "A Quick Run Down For the Next Week",
  "body_html": "<p>Watch the video, its why I make them! Its only 4 minutes long. </p><p>Overall the market is looking decent. With all the consolidations occurring, I am expecting breakouts…possibly next week. My speculation is to the upside, but if you want to wait for the breakout for directional confirmation, help yourself. </p><p>If you missed any of these posts and/or looking for a stock to buy, check out these posts:</p><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/recession-resistant-stock-break-out?r=4z8lgl\">Recession Resistant Stock Breakout</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/2-winning-stocks-with-strong-fundamentals?r=4z8lgl\">2 Winning Stocks From Rankings</a></strong></p></li></ul><p>I already mentioned in the video why Tesla is bullish.</p><p>One additional note, a few people have messaged me about the StockTok Dashboard. I do not upkeep that site, and I think it expired. The vast majority of people do not use it. Everything is updated at the <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a></strong>, which includes my positions, StockTok ETF performance, recent updates and most importantly, the screened stocks in a buy zones. Swing by the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d7312c75-2778-49bd-9b8e-ccab72528629\">Main Chat</a> if you have any questions, during market hours! Just be sure to tag me, so I see it </p><p>Have a great weekend! Be sure to take some time off so you are fresh next week. </p><p>Lastly, please like ❤️ and re-stack 🔃, it really helps a lot. </p><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
